Author: peterwangze <1337917121@qq.com>
Date:   Sat Aug 22 18:40:17 2026 +0800

    EVO-002 Step 5: codex-responses protocol branch (SSE aggregation + R5-F1 call-time kill-switch + R4-F1/R4-F2 hardening)
    
    runOauthChat 4th protocol branch -> runCodexResponsesChat: stream:true forced (EV-028 P5 stream:false rejected), SSE 12-event chain aggregation (delta concat fallback / output_item.done slot text / terminal usage / failed+error events), H3-9 headers (originator=dsh-agent-router honest self-id, chatgpt-account-id, OpenAI-Beta responses=experimental), H3-14 error semantics (401/403 re-login, 429 resets_at minutes).
    
    R5-F1 (P2, must-close): resolvePresetCredential entry kill-switch -- oauthExperimental=false reports 实验通路已关闭 before any credential read or refresh network call; single point covers runOauthChat + oauthDiscover consumers (resolveOauthToken preset arm now delegates).
    
    R4-F1 (P3, promoted must-close): refresh timeout timer now covers headers + payload (json) phase -- body-phase stall abort closes stale-lock-takeover overlap window (also dissolves R5-F3 same-instance lockToken degradation); R4-F2: AbortController typeof guard removed (fail-loud Node>=18 baseline). R5-F4: originator value pinned in smoke.
    
    Tests: smoke 659->683 (19 branch assertions + 5 body-phase timeout assertions), oauth-credentials 75->80; metrics 31 / parity 14 / loopback 20 all green, 0 regression.

